  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Weapon-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-stick-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/badge/requires-mstv.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>更多武器變體</h1>\n<p>使用你喜愛的樹木製作武器。劍現在也根據材質區分了不同的變體，例如使用深板岩圓石或黑曜石製成的劍，而不僅限於普通的圓石。<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Weapon-Variants/pres/mr_desc_banner.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>新增 101 種新的<em>劍</em>、101 種新的<em>長矛</em>、11 種新的<em>弓</em>、11 種新的<em>弩</em>以及 11 種新的<em>箭矢</em>，其中包括適用於所有藥水效果的附魔箭矢變體。</h3>\n<p>如需 101 種新的<em>斧頭</em>，請查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-tool-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多工具變體</a>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/9sks7.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;蒼白橡木與<img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/q6jqi.png\" alt=\"\">銅材質由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hunnycakehorse</a>提供</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>1.1.0+：</h2>\n<p>怪物有概率根據其所處的生物羣系和情境，生成攜帶特定武器和箭矢變體的樣貌。它們也會掉落這些物品作為戰利品。<img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/z8cs4.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/mcc14.gif\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/uuslw.gif\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
